1  | ∃x P(x)
2  | ∀x ∀y ((P(x) ∧ P(y)) → (x=y))
   |----
3  | | [a] P(a)
   | |----
4  | | | [b]
   | | |----
5  | | | | P(b)
   | | | |----
6  | | | | ∀y ((P(b) ∧ P(y)) → (b=y))         ∀ Elim: 2
7  | | | | (P(b) ∧ P(a)) → (b=a)              ∀ Elim: 6
8  | | | | P(b) ∧ P(a)                        ∧ Intro: 5, 3
9  | | | | b=a                                → Elim: 7,8
10 | | | P(b) → (b=a)                         → Intro: 5-9
11 | | ∀y (P(y) → (y=a))                      ∀ Intro: 4-10
12 | | P(a) ∧ ∀y (P(y) → (y=a))               ∧ Intro: 3, 11
13 | | ∃x (P(x) ∧ ∀y (P(y) → (y=x)))          ∃ Intro: 12
14 | ∃x (P(x) ∧ ∀y (P(y) → (y=x)))            ∃ Elim: 1, 3-13
